      },
      "message": "feat(geometry): conservative bit-packed raster of geo2d regions\n\nAdd camcraft_geometry::nesting::raster, the CPU first-filter raster of\nthe raster nest (#2525, slice 1). Over-approximate mode (parts) marks\neach cell whose closed square touches the closed region; free mode\n(usable sheet) marks a cell only when its closed square is inside the\nopen region. Integer arithmetic only (i128, checked), rows packed in\nu32 words, a named error for each refusal and a cell limit.\n\nFixes #2612\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
